                        "description": {
                          "value": "You coat yourself in nature's power. Choose air, earth, fire, metal, water, or wood; the spell gains that trait. You become completely covered by armor formed from that element, gaining a +1 circumstance bonus to AC and resistance 5 to two types of damage based on the element you choose.\n\nAir bludgeoning and electricity; Earth bludgeoning and poison; Fire fire and slashing; Metal acid and slashing; Water cold and piercing; Wood piercing and void."
